"The district places the 60,000-square-foot health building at its center with surface and structured parking behind, a pharmacy drive-through lane, and a healing garden between buildings. All entries are level and covered.",
"60,000 square foot health building at the district center","Pharmacy, dental, and wellness studios on one block","Healing garden between the buildings","All entries level, covered, and accessible",
"Health facility licensing verified with the state authority.",
