"The district plans 800 homes within a half mile of the station, ground-floor retail on every block, and a car-share and bike hub at the platform. Parking is pooled and priced; the streets belong to people.",
"800 homes within a half mile of the station","Ground-floor retail on every block","Car-share and bike hub at the platform","Pooled priced parking; streets belong to people",
"Transit agency coordination on station area capacity.",
